    "body": "Neovim detects `*.tfvars` as `terraform-vars`, which `tofu_ls` doesn't list, so it attaches to Terraform config but not to variable files. tofu-ls accepts `terraform-vars` as well as `terraform` ([docs/USAGE.md](https://github.com/opentofu/tofu-ls/blob/main/docs/USAGE.md)), and the Neovim example there lists both.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-20T13:57:28Z",
